     "excerpt": "I can accept the current S2 approach: 7% as the model limit, with results above 5% triggering regulator review and a corrective-action plan, and no automatic sales ban. ... The current S5 also preserves regulator assessment rather than automatic recall. I’m ready to sign this version."
